I reproduced a remaining API Client bug in an in-memory probe: replacing an open collection with another folder that has the same collection ID leaves the first folder’s request fields under the second folder’s name, with no new document load. This is a realistic case for copied or cloned collections; Rust scopes their private data by both folder and ID.
